{"path":"/2019/08/vi-x-liturginiai-rubai.html","kind":"article","title":"VI-X a. liturginiai rūbai","description":"Ortodoksų kunigas Grigorijus Musochranovas rekonstravo VI-X a. vyskupų rūbus pagal Ravenoje esančią mozaiką (ir, galbūt, kitus liudijimus). ...","published":"2019-08-01T14:43:00+03:00","section":"Bažnyčios gyvenimas","labels":["liturgika","liturginiai rūbai"],"hero":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-GM5TOdyi42w/XULNDA0_hiI/AAAAAAAAqu8/3R8qSTgjvFYo0lDFHJitkGpOP_agrezjgCK4BGAYYCw/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/2.jpg","html":"Ortodoksų kunigas Grigorijus Musochranovas rekonstravo VI-X a. vyskupų rūbus pagal Ravenoje esančią mozaiką (ir, galbūt, kitus liudijimus).<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-GM5TOdyi42w/XULNDA0_hiI/AAAAAAAAqu8/3R8qSTgjvFYo0lDFHJitkGpOP_agrezjgCK4BGAYYCw/s1600/2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-GM5TOdyi42w/XULNDA0_hiI/AAAAAAAAqu8/3R8qSTgjvFYo0lDFHJitkGpOP_agrezjgCK4BGAYYCw/s320/2.jpg\" width=\"212\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Vyskupo liturginiai rūbai</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-7_8aaZ2XjsU/XULN8pC4v5I/AAAAAAAAqvg/G0uqoNm03MEjSgjRWiGxNpYpvkF5I0hDQCK4BGAYYCw/s1600/67378753_2881095205264999_5522008919544692736_o.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-7_8aaZ2XjsU/XULN8pC4v5I/AAAAAAAAqvg/G0uqoNm03MEjSgjRWiGxNpYpvkF5I0hDQCK4BGAYYCw/s320/67378753_2881095205264999_5522008919544692736_o.jpg\" width=\"172\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Prototipas - Ravenos mozaika</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-exH3Js9QOEo/XULNHpTyiJI/AAAAAAAAqvI/dV478B2puXoJYonxHLHXX5n9TOJj1CgBACK4BGAYYCw/s1600/2.2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><span></span><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-exH3Js9QOEo/XULNHpTyiJI/AAAAAAAAqvI/dV478B2puXoJYonxHLHXX5n9TOJj1CgBACK4BGAYYCw/s320/2.2.jpg\" width=\"212\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td><div>\nOrantos pozicijoje. Po arnotu matosi</div>\n<div>\nraudona stula ir baltas sticharius (alba)</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-unXtryOiB7k/XULNOye4DkI/AAAAAAAAqvQ/PoD-vAel89ES_whQNOQE3sirghTNY43IACK4BGAYYCw/s1600/3.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-unXtryOiB7k/XULNOye4DkI/AAAAAAAAqvQ/PoD-vAel89ES_whQNOQE3sirghTNY43IACK4BGAYYCw/s320/3.jpg\" width=\"212\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Iš nugaros. Matomas omofirijaus (palijaus) kryžius</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\nDaugelyje ikonų senieji šventieji vyskupai vaizduojami būtent tokia apranga. Tiesa, daugelis turtingesnių katedrų vyskupų turėjo kryžiais papuoštus arnotus, vadintus \"polistavrionais\":<br>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-O-TXPgwCCkQ/XULPCBrSq6I/AAAAAAAAqvs/PeqxmZ6Nok4yhOOwIUVInc6Yy9vn8rh_gCK4BGAYYCw/s1600/GregoryofNazianzus.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-O-TXPgwCCkQ/XULPCBrSq6I/AAAAAAAAqvs/PeqxmZ6Nok4yhOOwIUVInc6Yy9vn8rh_gCK4BGAYYCw/s320/GregoryofNazianzus.jpg\" width=\"213\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Šventojo vyskupo ikona</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\nKunigai tais laikais rengdavosi beveik taip pat, kaip vyskupai, tik neturėjo omoforo (palijaus). Omoforas - tai išskirtinis vyskupo ženklas. Taipogi nebuvo įprasta kunigams puošti savo arnotų kryžiais.<br>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-7p1CtJPq7vc/XULPft3A-RI/AAAAAAAAqv4/dWY9HXZtUL4fjr3KNEE8qT4GEvrQc3QWQCK4BGAYYCw/s1600/kun3.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"212\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-7p1CtJPq7vc/XULPft3A-RI/AAAAAAAAqv4/dWY9HXZtUL4fjr3KNEE8qT4GEvrQc3QWQCK4BGAYYCw/s320/kun3.jpg\" width=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Tipinė kunigo apranga VI-X a.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-azTSdlZo_ZI/XULPkx1v_MI/AAAAAAAAqwA/fD_ot4-2J4gjiNir70zuOnbDssLjrrJkQCK4BGAYYCw/s1600/kun%2B2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821204518im_/https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-azTSdlZo_ZI/XULPkx1v_MI/AAAAAAAAqwA/fD_ot4-2J4gjiNir70zuOnbDssLjrrJkQCK4BGAYYCw/s320/kun%2B2.jpg\" width=\"212\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td><div>\nKunigas be arnoto, su stichariumi (alba)</div>\n<div>\nir stula (epitrachiliu). Esama dviejų anachronizmų -</div>\n<div>\nvietoje diržo naudota virvė, stichariaus viršus neturi turėti apsiuvų</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\nKun. Grigorijus nesirengė kaip diakonas, bet tai būtų nesunku - diakonai atrodė kaip kunigas be arnoto, tik stula buvo ne permesta per kaklą, o apjuosta įstrižai arba sujuosta kryžiumi, kaip tai ir daroma šiandien.<br>\n<br>\n<i>Nuotraukos paimtos iš viešo kunigo profilio vk.com</i>","capture":"20190821204518","source":"http://www.ortodoksas.lt/2019/08/vi-x-liturginiai-rubai.html"}
